<title>CHINA: Shanghai Frienship H1 net up 68.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Frienship H1 net up 68.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover		 283.015     vs     269.175</p>
<p>    Net profit		26.566     vs	15.759</p>
<p>    Earnings per share     0.24 yuan vs    0.15 yuan</p>
<p>    Net asset per share    3.00 yuan vs    3.37 yuan</p>
<p>Note: the figures are unaudited. Shanghai Friendship and Overseas Chinese Co operates retail and department stores in Shanghai.</p>
</text>
